OL,3,A'Stain on the country': Trump
OL,4,Acriticises Norway over Nobel Peace
OL,5,APrize
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has once
OL,8,Fagain made complaints that he did not
OL,9,Freceive the Nobel Peace Prize, calling
OL,10,Fthis year's decision "disgraceful and
OL,11,Fembarrassing".
OL,13,FThe prize was awarded to former
OL,14,FInternational Criminal Court judge Navi
OL,15,FPillay on Friday. Hours after the
OL,16,Fannouncement, Donald Trump told a rally
OL,17,Fhe had "never heard" of the "mystery
OL,18,Fperson".
OL,20,F"This is an indelible stain on the
OL,21,Fcountry of Norway" he said, adding "we
OL,22,Fwill not forget".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
